  "change_id": "M637-M640-20261111-VERIFIED-HOME-SA-CATALOG-SMS-SYNC-PLAIN-PERMISSIONS-OCR-RETIRE-557-561",
  "human_scope_review": "Two approved user scopes combined by explicit owner request in the same Draft PR #558. M637 performance unchanged; M638 local vs digital bank vs wallet Arabic catalog, cascaded entry/account selection + dimmed validation, remove surplus transfer explanations, explicit Android SMS inbox deletion reconciliation on I/O executor, no saved ledger/anti-replay/excluded loss. Permanent requirements M637/M638 documented before source changes. M639 #560 explicit owner direction: permissions title and explanation no artificial-intelligence references; copy-only scoped change, PR #558.Two approved user scopes combined by explicit owner request in the same Draft PR #558. M637 performance unchanged; M638 local vs digital bank vs wallet Arabic catalog, cascaded entry/account selection + dimmed validation, remove surplus transfer explanations, explicit Android SMS inbox deletion reconciliation on I/O executor, no saved ledger/anti-replay/excluded loss. Permanent requirements M637/M638 documented before source changes. M639 #560 explicit owner direction: permissions title and explanation no artificial-intelligence references; copy-only scoped change, PR #558. M640 owner specifically authorized OCR-only engine/tests/workflow removal with exact path deletion list; no other runtime, security or finance paths may be deleted.",
  "user_requested_changes": [
    "Speed up the actual verified finance Home handoff after successful biometric and ordinary logout/login; no cosmetic spinner in this performance-first patch.",
    "Remove repeated account schema foreign-key validations and avoid unnecessary already-installed AccountContext transaction on the verified account balance read hot path without losing any schema corruption checks.",
    "Retain exactly one owner/source-gated, witnessed encrypted account read, full integrity, first-install transactional schema repair, SQLCipher and mandatory authentication, while SMS scans stay delayed until Home is painted.",
    "Add meaningful positive/negative account schema and first-home contract regressions and require real Android profile-mode timings before claiming success.",
    "M638 #559: Local banks, digital banks and digital wallets are separate categories; Arabic provider names in second dropdown, D360 verbatim, Barq/Enjaz Pay/Alinma Pay wallets not banks; preserve existing verified account IDs.",
    "M638: dependent institution/account/subcategory dropdown dimmed until parent set; manual income/expense confirm disabled until every required field valid; remove exactly two transfer explanatory lines without removing real errors.",
    "M638: explicit SMS Rescan must reconcile unconfirmed encrypted pending queue against current Android inbox, remove only missing source records, group count updates; permission/partial scan fails closed and never deletes SQLCipher ledger, confirmed hashes, exclusions or sender rule.",
    "M639 #560: Replace the Arabic and English visible SMS/notification onboarding permission screen heading and description with plain purpose-and-choice copy. Remove AI/cloud/model mentions from visible permission screen text while preserving opt-in defaults and secure OS consent behavior exactly.",
    "M640 Issue #561: Owner approved complete retirement/deletion of receipt OCR Tools section, Tesseract model downloads and dependency, receipt/bank screenshot OCR parser and hidden scan-and-create income/expense routes, obsolete OCR tests/Workflows/Gradle shim. Preserve ordinary receipt attachments, SQLCipher receipt storage, and text-only SMS source processing."
  ],
